# Project-local optional tool binaries installed by `yd tools install` | 由 `yd tools install` 安装到项目内的可选工具二进制
.yd/
# Runtime uploads (message attachments) | 运行期上传（消息附件）
data/attachments/
# Node identity is per-instance runtime state; committing or sharing it duplicates the node | 节点身份是每实例运行期状态，入库或共享会造成节点重复
data/node-id
data/.node-id-*
# Local database files (the default landing spot of yd new --db sqlite, WAL sidecars included) | 本地数据库文件（yd new --db sqlite 的默认落点，含 WAL 边车文件）
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm

# `yd build` 生成的压缩资产 | minified assets produced by `yd build`
web/static/**/*.min.js
web/static/**/*.min.css
